
>> countries := Феҳрист нав
	~ ['Switzerland']
	~ ['Italy']
	~ ['Germany'].

>> foods := Феҳрист нав
	~ ['Rösti']
	~ ['Spaghetti']
	~ ['Sauerkraut'].


>> counter := 0.
foods аз-рӯи: countries, ҳар-як: { :key :value
	counter ҷамъ: 1.
}.

Баромад навис: (['we serve counter dishes'] counter: counter), сатри-нав.

>> counter := 42.
['TrytosortthiswithoutsegfaultingButActualNumberDe✎dsOnOS'] аломатҳо мураттаб: { :v
	counter ҷамъ: 0.
}.

Баромад навис: (['we sort counter dishes'] counter: counter), сатри-нав.


>> counter := 0.
{
	{
		counter ҷамъ: 1.
	} × (3 + 1 + 1 × 0.5).
} × 100.


Баромад навис: (['we calculate counter numbers.'] counter: counter), сатри-нав.

